   "why": "A 124 pt number sits over 7 day circles, so a 3 day streak reads in 1 glance: 3 orange checks done, 4 gray days to go.",
   "html": "<div class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week\"><div class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__num\">3</div><div class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__label\">day streak</div><div class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__card\"><div class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__day\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__name\">Su</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__dot x-duolingo-streak-week__dot--done\"><svg class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__check\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.5 33.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"11.7,16.1 15.8,20.3 23.7,12.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"3.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__day\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__name\">Mo</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__dot x-duolingo-streak-week__dot--done\"><svg class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__check\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.5 33.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"11.7,16.1 15.8,20.3 23.7,12.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"3.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__day\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__name x-duolingo-streak-week__name--today\">Tu</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__dot x-duolingo-streak-week__dot--done\"><svg class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__check\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.5 33.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"11.7,16.1 15.8,20.3 23.7,12.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"3.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__day\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__name\">We</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__dot\"></span></div><div class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__day\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__name\">Th</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__dot\"></span></div><div class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__day\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__name\">Fr</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__dot\"></span></div><div class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__day\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__name\">Sa</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-streak-week__dot\"></span></div></div></div>",
   "css": ".x-duolingo-streak-week{position:relative;width:337px;height:295px;font-family:\"Nunito\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;line-height:1;letter-spacing:0;color:#AFAFAF;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap}.x-duolingo-streak-week *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}.x-duolingo-streak-week__num{position:absolute;left:0;top:0.5px;width:100%;height:132px;padding-left:2px;font-size:169px;font-weight:800;line-height:132px;transform:scaleX(0.875);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FFB725 0,#FFA10D 124px);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}.x-duolingo-streak-week__label{position:absolute;left:0;top:132px;width:100%;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;line-height:48px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#FF9600}.x-duolingo-streak-week__card{position:absolute;left:0;top:200.6px;width:337px;height:94.3px;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding-top:15.9px;background:#FFFFFF;border:1.9px solid #E5E5E5;border-radius:13.3px}.x-duolingo-streak-week__day{width:45.2px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}.x-duolingo-streak-week__name{display:block;height:16px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;line-height:16px}.x-duolingo-streak-week__name--today{color:#FF9600}.x-duolingo-streak-week__dot{display:block;width:33.4px;height:33.4px;margin-top:10.5px;border-radius:50%;background:#E5E5E5}.x-duolingo-streak-week__dot--done{background:#FF9600}.x-duolingo-streak-week__check{display:block;width:33.4px;height:33.4px}",
   "fonts": [
    {
     "family": "Nunito",
     "weight": 800
    }
   ],
   "size": {
    "w": 337,
    "h": 295
   },
   "backdrop": null,
   "prompt": "Build a streak week card like Duolingo's.\n- Centered stack, 337 x 295 pt: number, label, week card.\n- Number: Nunito 800, 169 pt, glyph 124 x 75 pt, vertical gradient #FFB725 to #FFA10D.\n- Label \"day streak\": Nunito 800, 34 pt, letter-spacing -0.01em, #FF9600, baseline 46 pt under the number.\n- Week card: 337 x 94 pt, 27 pt under the label, #FFFFFF fill, 1.9 pt #E5E5E5 border, 13.3 pt radius.\n- 7 columns at a 45.2 pt pitch. Day initials: Nunito 800, 16 pt, #AFAFAF; today's initial turns #FF9600.\n- 10.5 pt under each initial, a 33.4 pt circle. Done: #FF9600 with a white 3.6 pt check, round caps. Upcoming: #E5E5E5.\n- Data rule: the number equals the run of days done. Fill 1 circle per day done, left to right.\n- When a day completes: pop its circle (scale 0.6 to 1.1 to 1, 300 ms), draw the check, then count the number up.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
  },
