   "why": "Each tapped word jumps to the answer line and leaves a gray slot of its size, so the 8 bank spots hold their place while the sentence builds.",
   "html": "<div class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__rule\"></span><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__rule x-duolingo-word-bank__rule--2\"></span><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__rule x-duolingo-word-bank__rule--3\"></span><div class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__answer\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__tile x-duolingo-word-bank__tile--ok x-duolingo-word-bank__w-i\">I</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__tile x-duolingo-word-bank__tile--ok x-duolingo-word-bank__w-need\">need</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__tile x-duolingo-word-bank__tile--ok x-duolingo-word-bank__w-more\">more</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__tile x-duolingo-word-bank__tile--ok x-duolingo-word-bank__w-coffee\">coffee!</span></div><div class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__row\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__slot x-duolingo-word-bank__w-s1\"></span><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__tile x-duolingo-word-bank__w-intelligent\">intelligent</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__tile x-duolingo-word-bank__w-lot\">lot</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__slot x-duolingo-word-bank__w-s2\"></span></div><div class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__row x-duolingo-word-bank__row--2\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__tile x-duolingo-word-bank__w-wants\">wants</span><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__slot x-duolingo-word-bank__w-s3\"></span><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__slot x-duolingo-word-bank__w-s4\"></span><span class=\"x-duolingo-word-bank__tile x-duolingo-word-bank__w-car\">car</span></div></div>",
   "css": ".x-duolingo-word-bank{position:relative;width:362px;height:280px;font-family:\"Nunito\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:20.5px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#4B4B4B;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap}.x-duolingo-word-bank *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}.x-duolingo-word-bank__rule{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;display:block;width:100%;height:1.9px;background:#E5E5E5}.x-duolingo-word-bank__rule--2{top:56.6px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__rule--3{top:113.9px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__answer{position:absolute;left:0.8px;top:5.4px;display:flex;gap:10.6px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__row{position:absolute;left:0;top:175.9px;width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;gap:5.1px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__row--2{top:229.1px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__tile{display:block;height:48.3px;padding-bottom:0.6px;line-height:40.7px;background:#FFFFFF;border:2.4px solid #E5E5E5;border-bottom-width:4.6px;border-radius:10px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__tile--ok{height:46.8px;padding-bottom:0.4px;line-height:39.7px;color:#58A601;background:#D7FEB7;border-color:#A6EC70;border-bottom-width:4.3px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__slot{display:block;height:48.4px;margin-top:2.1px;background:#E5E5E5;border-radius:10px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-i{width:39.3px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-need{width:75.8px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-more{width:79.1px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-coffee{width:92.4px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-intelligent{width:124.6px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-lot{width:57px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-wants{width:88px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-car{width:62.3px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-s1{width:56.6px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-s2{width:75.4px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-s3{width:119.9px}.x-duolingo-word-bank__w-s4{width:71.8px}",
   "fonts": [
    {
     "family": "Nunito",
     "weight": 400
    }
   ],
   "size": {
    "w": 362,
    "h": 280
   },
   "backdrop": null,
   "prompt": "Build a word bank with answer lines like Duolingo's.\n- 362 x 280 pt. 1.9 pt #E5E5E5 rules at y 0, 57 and 114 pt.\n- Bank: 2 centered rows of 4 spots, top at 176 pt, 53 pt row pitch, 5 pt gaps.\n- Tile: 48 pt tall, 16 pt side padding, 10 pt radius, #FFFFFF fill, 2.4 pt #E5E5E5 border and a 4.6 pt bottom edge, like a key.\n- Word: Nunito 400, 20.5 pt, #4B4B4B, centered.\n- Used spot: a flat #E5E5E5 slot of the tile's width, 2 pt lower.\n- Answer tiles sit on rule 1 from the left, 10.6 pt apart.\n- Correct: answer tiles turn #D7FEB7, border #A6EC70, words #58A601.\n- Pressed: move the tile down 2.2 pt; bottom edge 2.4 pt.\n- Data rule: tap a bank tile to append it to the answer; tap an answer tile to return it. Animate moves with a 200 ms FLIP.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
  },
  {
   "id": "duolingo-lesson-header",
   "name": "Lesson progress header",
   "type": "Headers",
   "order": 20,
   "source": {
    "shot": "s2",
    "box": [
     25,
     30,
     552,
     47
    ],
    "crop": "/taste/media/elements/src/duolingo-lesson-header.jpg"
   },
   "why": "One 22 pt row holds the exit, a bar at 44% and an energy count that drops from 25 to 22, so progress and cost read together.",
   "html": "<div class=\"x-duolingo-lesson-header\"><svg class=\"x-duolingo-lesson-header__close\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M1.3 1.3L18.7 18.7M18.7 1.3L1.3 18.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B7B7B7\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"x-duolingo-lesson-header__track\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-lesson-header__fill\"><span class=\"x-duolingo-lesson-header__shine\"></span></span></span><svg class=\"x-duolingo-lesson-header__energy\" viewBox=\"0 0 28.2 22.1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"28.2\" height=\"22.1\" rx=\"4.6\" fill=\"#FF86CD\"/><path d=\"M1.9 3.6Q1.9 1.9 3.6 1.9L7.4 1.9Q9.2 1.9 8.6 3.6L4.3 17.6Q3.8 19.1 2.9 19.1Q1.9 19.1 1.9 17.9Z\" fill=\"#FEAADC\"/><path d=\"M14.6 3.4L10 12.5L13.1 12.5L13.2 18.3L18.5 9.6L15.1 9.6Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"x-duolingo-lesson-header__nub\"></span><span class=\"x-duolingo-lesson-header__count\">25</span></div>",
   "css": ".x-duolingo-lesson-header{display:flex;align-items:center;width:355px;height:22.4px;font-family:\"Nunito\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;line-height:1;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#FF86CE;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}.x-duolingo-lesson-header *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}.x-duolingo-lesson-header__close{display:block;flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;margin-left:0.1px}.x-duolingo-lesson-header__track{position:relative;display:block;flex:none;width:248.6px;height:16.8px;margin-left:11.8px;border-radius:8.4px;background:#E5E5E5}.x-duolingo-lesson-header__fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;display:block;width:43.6%;height:100%;border-radius:8.4px;background:#58CC02}.x-duolingo-lesson-header__shine{position:absolute;left:4.1px;right:3.8px;top:3.8px;display:block;height:2.7px;border-radius:1.4px;background:#7BD636}.x-duolingo-lesson-header__energy{display:block;flex:none;width:28.2px;height:22.1px;margin-left:12.2px}.x-duolingo-lesson-header__nub{display:block;flex:none;width:3.2px;height:7.2px;margin-left:0.9px;border-radius:1.6px;background:#FF86CD}.x-duolingo-lesson-header__count{position:relative;top:-0.3px;display:block;flex:none;margin-left:8px;padding-top:1.8px;font-size:17.4px;line-height:20.6px;letter-spacing:0.08em}",
   "fonts": [
    {
     "family": "Nunito",
     "weight": 800
    }
   ],
   "size": {
    "w": 355,
    "h": 22
   },
   "backdrop": null,
   "prompt": "Build a lesson progress header like Duolingo's.\n- One 355 x 22 pt row, items on one center line, 21 pt screen margins.\n- Close X: 20 pt, 1.9 pt #B7B7B7 crossing strokes, round caps. Pressed: 60% opacity.\n- Track: 12 pt after the X, free width (249 pt), 16.8 pt #E5E5E5 pill.\n- Fill: #58CC02 pill, width = lesson progress; 2.7 pt #7BD636 highlight 3.8 pt below its top, inset 4 pt.\n- Energy icon: 12 pt after the track, 28 x 22 pt #FF86CD tile, 4.6 pt radius, #FEAADC slanted sheen top left, white bolt.\n- A 3.2 x 7.2 pt #FF86CD battery tip, 1 pt to its right.\n- Count: Nunito 800, 17.4 pt, letter-spacing 0.08em, #FF86CE, 8 pt after the tip.\n- Data rule: grow the fill over 300 ms ease-out per answer; drop the count by 1 per lesson.\n- Combo state: after a run of right answers, fill #FF9600, highlight #FEAA31.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
  }
 ]
}
